('Active refuge and world creation support an inferred internal floor, with outside hardware vulnerability.','Hosts have substantial independence from former human owners, but their substrate and access remain external constraints.','Active host-person scenario counts world creation, research, care-like and technical roles; simulations and dormant files do not automatically add autonomous persons.'),
